 めい ˙˚ ᕱ⑅ᕱ ˚˙  ❤︎"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-27721":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日向坂46 京都府出身の松田好花です(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217FK33PFQPV7NDNXBPWCW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">昨日は名古屋で8枚目シングルの個別握手会がありました！！\n2部制やったから、たくさん会えなくて物足りなく感じましたが、楽しかったです(*´∇｀*)\n来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217GQ7NEJN9EVQFBE0EVD2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nあんまり普段着ーひん系統やけど着てみた！！ひよたんが撮ってくれました(´▽`) "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217HQFPNBVE0PVRY8GT7NR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217JPZ2C5GXMJPH2TEAMWH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n2部の髪型！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂いたお花を紹介します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217KP2WTG9QAEBB8RJRPJP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217MPNACFSMDSDMHMB0PDY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217NRX2CTA60DGRTDCTMP2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか今回ピンク多く感じるのは私だけ？笑\nたまたまかな？いや、サイリウムカラーに入ってるからかな？笑\nお花だけじゃなくて、メッセージカードからも気持ちが伝わってきて嬉しいです(^○^)いつもありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ217PTY5F6ZC0M0QJ42WMW5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">金ちゃんが撮ってくれた！自然光に当たると茶髪に見える(´⊙ω⊙`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは