ph","text":"最後まで見てくださってありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高本彩花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"627\n  "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21079":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HUSTLE PRESS連載「けやき坂46 かけのぼるまでまてない！」に登場させていただきます！！！(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HUSSTLE PRESSで初めてソロ撮影していただき、とっても楽しい撮影でした( › ·̮ ‹ )♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非みなさん見て下さいね\\( ¨̮ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットたくさん載せます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2MWNMSXM19CZVM1T2QP38","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2MXN9B6N58BGW9BHYEZJ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2MYPZVYHZ7A1MJWPFPVC5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2MZMQV1M6239VZGDRND8Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2N0Q8KZKK90S0ED4YE6D1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2N1SF49Y0AM7ZMH0DW6Z7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG2N2RZM7V0PKB1JY6ET77Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブまでもうすぐだ〜!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょんこより(o•ᴗ•o)੭⁾⁾"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-31488":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。滋賀県出身 高校3年生 17歳欅坂46 二期生 武元唯衣です🍀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46のコラボカフェが発表されましたね!👏🏻✨東京、大阪、名古屋に期間限定でオープンされます(^ν^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なオリジナルメニューにグッズ!どれも美味しそうで可愛くてカッコよくて、欅坂がいっぱい詰まっていてすごく楽しみです( ; ; )❤︎\nぜひぜひ、お越し下さい🌼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"開催期間は東京 :11/21(木)〜1/13(月) 大阪 :11/22(金)〜1/19(日)名古屋:11/28(木)〜1/19(日)です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはこちらをご覧下さい☺︎↓https://keyakizaka46-cafe.jp/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\n今週の土曜日の11/9に三重県のナガシマスパーランドで行われる、\nMBSラジオ公開収録イベント「アッパレ オレたち ゴチャ祭〜ナガシマスパーランドからやってまーす〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に、小池さん、土生さん、井上、田村と出演させていただくことが決定しました!🎢✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共演者の方々から色々なことを学んで吸収できるよう、頑張ります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チケットや観覧のことなど、詳しいことはこちらをご覧下さい☺︎↓https://www.nagashima-onsen.co.jp/spaland/info/20191003.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもぜひ、お越し下さい🌼待ってます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は気温差も激しく、ますます冬を感じるようになってきましたね❄️ゆっくりお風呂に浸かって、暖かい布団で寝てくださいね〜^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、武元唯衣でした🍀バイバイ〜👋🏻"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46/member/moblog/201911/mobBXei6H.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"official"}}